{"q":"360","t":"Sort Transformed Array","d":"Medium","p":true,"c":null,"h":["x^2 + x  will form a parabola.","Parameter A in:  A * x^2 + B * x + C dictates the shape of the parabola.</br>\r\nPositive A means the parabola remains concave (high-low-high), but negative A inverts the parabola to be convex (low-high-low)."],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"sortTransformedArray\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"nums\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer[]\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"a\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"b\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"c\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer[]\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Math","slug":"math"},{"name":"Two Pointers","slug":"two-pointers"},{"name":"Sorting","slug":"sorting"}]}